Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:43.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn新愚公和谐宋-M\fs150\fad(522,518)\c&HE1E54B&\shad3\4c&H394F30&\4a&H59&\pos(1251.429,582.857)}新学期
